   "talk": [
    {
     "text": "You're Teo's sister. Sit. No, closer than that, I don't bite and I don't catch things. Your brother owed me nothing. That's rare. I liked him.",
     "once": true,
     "set": "met_oru"
    },
    {
     "text": "The red lamp dock is an insult and I didn't build it. Highmark's inspector likes to see it lit. Use my dock when you've a tag that won't start an argument."
    },
    {
     "text": "A yellow permit would open the Outer Harbor to you. It would also close half the doors on this raft. I sell both kinds of key."
    },
    {
     "if": "heard_signal",
     "text": "Lowlight numbers? Don't say them out loud on my deck. Ask the Keeper. She reads that sort of thing like scripture."
    },
    {
     "text": "Highmark sells us our own fish back in sealed tins. I take a margin. Somebody has to keep the lamps lit."
    }
   ]
  },
