   "talk": [
    {
     "text": "Deep-Born. You stand a little apart, like they taught you. Stand where you like here. The tide does not read wristbands.",
     "once": true
    },
    {
     "if": "heard_signal",
     "text": "Nine six, one two eight, minus. That is the plaza that fell. The Sounding. Lowlight left an ear on a red buoy there. Lower it at night, child, and do not hurry what you hear.",
     "set": "signal_decoded"
    },
    {
     "text": "Your brother asked me once what the Deep wants. I told him: what anything wants. To be heard. He wrote that down. I wish he hadn't."
    },
    {
     "text": "The tide is a judge. It doesn't hate anyone. That's what makes it frightening."
    },
    {
     "if": "finale_done",
     "text": "So. It has finished counting. Now we find out what it counts to."
    }
   ]
  },
