    {
     "text": "Wardens pass at night. Red light first, then the searchlight. Cut your engine, kill your lamp, sit behind something big. They hunt by noise as much as eyes."
    },
    {
     "text": "The Beacon comes round every fifteen seconds. Some nights, a while after it passes, the water hums back."
    },
    {
     "text": "Gulls go quiet before the sound. You'll notice."
    }
